3. H\f0\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng t\&#39;ednh s\u7889? gh\u7871? c\f1\lang1033\&#39;f2n tr\f0\lang1066\u7889?ng theo t\u7915?ng h\u7841?ng v\&#39;e9 (\f2\lang1033\&#39;f0\f0\lang1066\u7871?\f3\lang1033 m booking_passengers \&#39;f0\f1\&#39;e3 Confirmed).\par

