<a:Step>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\widctlpar\f0\fs20 1. Kh\&#39;e1ch nh\f1\lang1066\u7853?p Email v\&#39;e0 M\u7853?t kh\u7849?u.\par
2. H\u7879? th\u7889?ng x\&#39;e1c th\u7921?c CSRF token.\par
3. H\u7879? th\u7889?ng ki\u7875?m tra rate-limit (t\u7889?i \&#39;f0a 5 l\u7847?n sai li\&#39;ean ti\u7871?p / 60 gi\&#39;e2y).\f0\lang1033\par
4. H\f1\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng truy v\u7845?n user theo email, so kh\u7899?p m\u7853?t kh\u7849?u b\u7857?ng password_verify().\par
5. N\u7871?u \&#39;f0\&#39;fang: g\u7885?i session_regenerate_id(true), l\&#39;fdu user_id/role v\&#39;e0o session.\f0\lang1033\par

\pard 6. H\f1\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng tr\u7843? v\u7873? th\&#39;f4ng tin t\&#39;e0i kho\u7843?n, frontend chuy\u7875?n v\&#39;e0o S\u7843?nh Chung.\f2\lang1033\par
}
</a:Step>
