<a:Step>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f2\froman\fprq2\fcharset238 Times New Roman CE;}{\f3\fswiss\fcharset238 Arial;}{\f4\fnil\fcharset1 Cambria Math;}{\f5\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}{\*\mmathPr\mmathFont4\mwrapIndent1440 }\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\widctlpar\f0\fs20 1. Kh\&#39;e1ch m\f1\lang1066\u7903? khung chat, nh\u7853?p c\&#39;e2u h\u7887?i.\par
\f2\lang1033 2. H\f1\lang1066\u7879?\f2\lang1033  th\f1\lang1066\u7889?\f2\lang1033 ng ki\f1\lang1066\u7875?\f2\lang1033 m tra rate-limit (t\f1\lang1066\u7889?\f2\lang1033 i \&#39;f0a 20 tin nh\f1\lang1066\u7855?\f2\lang1033 n / 5 ph\&#39;fat / IP).\f0\par
\f2 3. H\f1\lang1066\u7879?\f2\lang1033  th\f1\lang1066\u7889?\f2\lang1033 ng thu th\f1\lang1066\u7853?\f2\lang1033 p ng\f1\lang1066\u7919?\f2\lang1033  c\f1\lang1066\u7843?\f2\lang1033 nh d\f1\lang1066\u7919?\f2\lang1033  li\f1\lang1066\u7879?\f2\lang1033 u th\f1\lang1066\u7853?\f2\lang1033 t: danh s\&#39;e1ch chuy\f1\lang1066\u7871?\f2\lang1033 n bay, v\&#39;e9 c\f1\lang1066\u7911?\f2\lang1033 a kh\&#39;e1ch (n\f1\lang1066\u7871?\f2\lang1033 u \&#39;f0\f0\&#39;e3 \f3\&#39;f0\&#39;e3\f0 ng nh\f1\lang1066\u7853?\f2\lang1033 p).\f0\par
4. N\f1\lang1066\u7871?u c\&#39;f3 c\u7845?u h\f0\lang1033\&#39;ecnh API key \f4\u8594?\f1\lang1066  g\u7885?i Claude API k\&#39;e8m ng\u7919? c\u7843?nh tr\&#39;ean \&#39;f0\u7875? tr\u7843? l\u7901?i t\u7921? nhi\&#39;ean.\f0\lang1033\par
\f1\lang1066 5. N\u7871?u kh\&#39;f4ng c\&#39;f3 API key (m\u7863?c \&#39;f0\u7883?nh) \f4\u8594?\f1\lang1066  d\&#39;f9ng b\u7897? tr\u7843? l\u7901?i th\&#39;f4ng minh vi\u7871?t b\u7857?ng PHP, nh\u7853?n di\u7879?n c\&#39;e2u h\u7887?i v\u7873? v\&#39;e9/chuy\u7871?n bay/m\f0\lang1033\&#39;e3 chuy\f1\lang1066\u7871?n c\u7909? th\u7875? v\&#39;e0 truy v\u7845?n th\u7859?ng Database \f3\lang1033\&#39;f0\f1\lang1066\u7875?\f2\lang1033  tr\f1\lang1066\u7843?\f2\lang1033  l\f1\lang1066\u7901?\f2\lang1033 i.\f0\par

\pard 6. H\f1\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng tr\u7843? k\u7871?t qu\u7843? v\u7873? khung chat.\f5\lang1033\par
}
</a:Step>
