<a:Throws>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset1 Cambria Math;}{\f3\froman\fprq2\fcharset238 Times New Roman CE;}{\f4\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}{\*\mmathPr\mmathFont2\mwrapIndent1440 }\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\widctlpar\f0\fs20 Qu\&#39;e1 20 tin nh\f1\lang1066\u7855?n / 5 ph\&#39;fat / c\&#39;f9ng IP \f2\u8594?\f1\lang1066  kho\&#39;e1 2 ph\&#39;fat (HTTP 429).\par
\f3\lang1033 G\f1\lang1066\u7885?\f3\lang1033 i Claude API l\f1\lang1066\u7895?\f3\lang1033 i (h\f1\lang1066\u7871?\f3\lang1033 t quota, m\f1\lang1066\u7845?\f3\lang1033 t m\f1\lang1066\u7841?\f3\lang1033 ng, sai key) \f2\u8594?\f3\lang1033  t\f1\lang1066\u7921?\f3\lang1033  \&#39;f0\f1\lang1066\u7897?\f3\lang1033 ng chuy\f1\lang1066\u7875?\f3\lang1033 n sang b\f1\lang1066\u7897?\f3\lang1033  tr\f1\lang1066\u7843?\f3\lang1033  l\f1\lang1066\u7901?\f3\lang1033 i d\f1\lang1066\u7921?\f3\lang1033  ph\f0\&#39;f2ng, kh\&#39;e1ch kh\&#39;f4ng th\f1\lang1066\u7845?y l\u7895?i k\u7929? thu\u7853?t.\par

\pard\f0\lang1033 Tin nh\f1\lang1066\u7855?n r\u7895?ng ho\u7863?c d\&#39;e0i qu\&#39;e1 500 k\f0\lang1033\&#39;fd t\f1\lang1066\u7921? \f2\u8594?\f1\lang1066  t\u7915? ch\u7889?i.\f4\lang1033\par
}
</a:Throws>
<a:PreCondition>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang1066 Kh\&#39;f4ng y\&#39;eau c\u7847?u \&#39;f0\&#39;e3ng nh\u7853?p.\f1\lang1033\par
}
</a:PreCondition>
<a:PostCondition>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f1\froman\fprq2\fcharset238 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang1066 C\&#39;e2u tr\u7843? l\u7901?i hi\u7875?n th\u7883? trong khung chat; kh\&#39;f4ng l\&#39;fdu l\u7883?ch s\u7917? h\u7897?i tho\u7841?i v\f1\u297?nh vi\f0\u7877?n v\&#39;e0o Database.\f2\lang1033\par
