\pard\widctlpar\f0\fs20 1. Kh\&#39;e1ch b\f1\lang1066\u7845?\f0\lang1033 m n\&#39;fat &quot;T\f1\lang1066\u7843?\f0\lang1033 i v\&#39;e9 \&#39;f0i\f1\lang1066\u7879?\f0\lang1033 n t\f1\lang1066\u7917?\f0\lang1033  (PDF)&quot;.\f2\par
2. H\f3\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng render n\u7897?i dung v\&#39;e9 (m\f2\lang1033\&#39;e3 \f4\&#39;f0\f3\lang1066\u7863?t ch\u7895?, h\&#39;e0nh kh\&#39;e1ch, chuy\u7871?n bay, gh\u7871?, t\u7893?ng ti\u7873?n) v\&#39;e0o 1 v\&#39;f9ng \u7849?n d\&#39;e0nh ri\&#39;eang \&#39;f0\u7875? in.\f2\lang1033\par
3. H\f3\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng g\u7885?i l\u7879?nh in c\u7911?a tr\f2\lang1033\&#39;ecnh duy\f3\lang1066\u7879?t (window.print()), \u7849?n to\&#39;e0n b\u7897? ph\u7847?n c\f2\lang1033\&#39;f2n l\f3\lang1066\u7841?i c\u7911?a trang.\par

\pard 4. Kh\&#39;e1ch ch\u7885?n &quot;L\&#39;fdu d\&#39;fd\u7899?i d\u7841?ng PDF&quot; (Save as PDF) trong h\u7897?p tho\u7841?i in.\f5\lang1033\par
}
</a:Step>
<a:UseCase.Extension>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 Kh\&#39;f4ng c\&#39;f3.\f1\par
}
</a:UseCase.Extension>
<a:Throws>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang1066 Kh\&#39;f4ng c\&#39;f3 ngo\u7841?i l\u7879? \&#39;f0\u7863?c bi\u7879?t \emdash  ho\u7841?t \&#39;f0\u7897?ng cho m\u7885?i v\&#39;e9 \&#39;f0ang hi\u7875?n th\u7883? tr\&#39;ean giao di\u7879?n.\f1\lang1033\par
}
</a:Throws>
<a:PreCondition>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fcharset238 Arial;}{\f1\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f3\froman\fprq2\fcharset238 Times New Roman CE;}{\f4\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\&#39;d0\f1\&#39;e3 c\&#39;f3 \&#39;edt nh\f2\lang1066\u7845?t 1 v\&#39;e9 (v\u7915?a \f0\lang1033\&#39;f0\f2\lang1066\u7863?\f3\lang1033 t xong / xem trong S\f2\lang1066\u7843?\f3\lang1033 nh Chung / tra c\f2\lang1066\u7913?\f3\lang1033 u b\f2\lang1066\u7857?\f3\lang1033 ng m\f1\&#39;e3 \f0\&#39;f0\f2\lang1066\u7863?\f3\lang1033 t ch\f2\lang1066\u7895?\f3\lang1033 ).\f4\par
}
</a:PreCondition>
<a:PostCondition>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang1066 Kh\&#39;e1ch nh\u7853?n \&#39;f0\&#39;fd\u7907?c file PDF v\&#39;e9 \&#39;f0i\u7879?n t\u7917? l\&#39;fdu tr\&#39;ean m\&#39;e1y, kh\&#39;f4ng c\u7847?n th\&#39;fd vi\u7879?n PDF ph\&#39;eda server.\f1\lang1033\par
}
</a:PostCondition>
