<a:Creator>khoa</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1785683832</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>khoa</a:Modifier>
<a:Step>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\widctlpar\f0\fs20 1. Admin v\&#39;e0o m\&#39;e0n h\&#39;ecnh Qu\f1\lang1066\u7843?n tr\u7883?.\par
2. H\u7879? th\u7889?ng t\u7921? \&#39;f0\u7897?ng truy v\u7845?n 50 b\u7843?n ghi audit_log g\u7847?n nh\u7845?t, s\u7855?p x\u7871?p m\u7899?i nh\u7845?t tr\&#39;fd\u7899?c.\f0\lang1033\par

\pard\f1\lang1066 3. H\u7879? th\u7889?ng hi\u7875?n th\u7883?: th\u7901?i gian, admin th\u7921?c hi\u7879?n, h\&#39;e0nh \&#39;f0\u7897?ng, \&#39;f0\u7889?i t\&#39;fd\u7907?ng b\u7883? t\&#39;e1c \&#39;f0\u7897?ng, chi ti\u7871?t.\f2\lang1033\par
}
</a:Step>
<a:UseCase.Extension>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 Kh\&#39;f4ng c\&#39;f3.\f1\par
}
</a:UseCase.Extension>
<a:Throws>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset1 Cambria Math;}{\f3\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}{\*\mmathPr\mmathFont2\mwrapIndent1440 }\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\widctlpar\f0\fs20 Kh\&#39;f4ng ph\f1\lang1066\u7843?i admin \f2\u8594?\f1\lang1066  t\u7915? ch\u7889?i\par

\pard Ch\&#39;fda c\&#39;f3 thao t\&#39;e1c qu\u7843?n tr\u7883? n\&#39;e0o \&#39;f0\&#39;fd\u7907?c ghi nh\u7853?n \f2\u8594?\f1\lang1066  hi\u7875?n th\u7883? b\u7843?ng tr\u7889?ng.\f3\lang1033\par
}
</a:Throws>
<a:PreCondition>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fcharset238 Arial;}{\f1\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f3\froman\fprq2\fcharset238 Times New Roman CE;}{\f4\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\&#39;d0\f1\&#39;e3 \f0\&#39;f0\&#39;e3\f1 ng nh\f2\lang1066\u7853?\f3\lang1033 p v\f2\lang1066\u7899?\f3\lang1033 i vai tr\f1\&#39;f2 admin (&lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt; &quot;\f0\&#39;d0\&#39;e3\f1 ng nh\f2\lang1066\u7853?\f3\lang1033 p&quot;).\f4\par
}
</a:PreCondition>
<a:PostCondition>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 Danh s\&#39;e1ch nh\f1\lang1066\u7853?t k\f0\lang1033\&#39;fd thao t\&#39;e1c hi\f1\lang1066\u7875?n th\u7883?, ph\u7909?c v\u7909? truy v\u7871?t tr\&#39;e1ch nhi\u7879?m qu\u7843?n tr\u7883? h\u7879? th\u7889?ng.\f2\lang1033\par
}
</a:PostCondition>
</o:UseCase>
<o:UseCase Id="o118">
<a:ObjectID>567F0DBC-75AA-43A6-B337-CB7B3FC12C7C</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>Hủy vé bằng mã booking</a:Name>
<a:Code>Huy_ve_bang_ma_booking</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1782526599</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>khoa</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1785684959</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>khoa</a:Modifier>
<a:Step>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\widctlpar\f0\fs20 1. Kh\&#39;e1ch nh\f1\lang1066\u7853?p M\f0\lang1033\&#39;e3 v\&#39;e9 v\&#39;e0 S\f1\lang1066\u7889? CMND/Passport.\par
2. H\u7879? th\u7889?ng ki\u7875?m tra rate-limit ch\u7889?ng d\f0\lang1033\&#39;f2 passport.\par
3. H\f1\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng t\f0\lang1033\&#39;ecm booking theo m\&#39;e3, x\&#39;e1c minh booking kh\&#39;f4ng thu\f1\lang1066\u7897?c t\&#39;e0i kho\u7843?n n\&#39;e0o (user_id NULL).\par
4. H\u7879? th\u7889?ng x\&#39;e1c minh passport kh\u7899?p v\u7899?i \&#39;edt nh\u7845?t 1 h\&#39;e0nh kh\&#39;e1ch trong v\&#39;e9.\par

\pard\f0\lang1033 5. H\f1\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng c\u7853?p nh\u7853?t status = &quot;Cancelled&quot;.\f2\lang1033\par
}
</a:Step>
<a:UseCase.Extension>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 Kh\&#39;f4ng c\&#39;f3.\f1\par
}
</a:UseCase.Extension>
<a:Throws>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f1\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset1 Cambria Math;}{\f3\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}{\*\mmathPr\mmathFont2\mwrapIndent1440 }\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\widctlpar\f0\fs20 Sai m\&#39;e3 v\&#39;e9 HO\f1\lang1066\u7862?C sai passport \f2\u8594?\f1\lang1066  1 th\&#39;f4ng b\&#39;e1o l\u7895?i g\u7897?p chung, kh\&#39;f4ng ti\u7871?t l\u7897? v\&#39;e9 n\&#39;e0o t\u7891?n t\u7841?i.\par
V\&#39;e9 thu\u7897?c v\u7873? 1 t\&#39;e0i kho\u7843?n H\u7897?i vi\&#39;ean \f2\u8594?\f1\lang1066  t\u7915? ch\u7889?i, y\&#39;eau c\u7847?u \&#39;f0\&#39;e3ng nh\u7853?p \&#39;f0\u7875? h\u7911?y.\f0\lang1033\par

\pard Qu\&#39;e1 5 l\f1\lang1066\u7847?n sai / 60 gi\&#39;e2y \f2\u8594?\f1\lang1066  kho\&#39;e1 5 ph\&#39;fat.\f3\lang1033\par
}
</a:Throws>
<a:PreCondition>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f1\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f2\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\widctlpar\f0\fs20\lang1066 Kh\&#39;f4ng y\&#39;eau c\u7847?u \&#39;f0\&#39;e3ng nh\u7853?p. Kh\&#39;e1ch bi\u7871?t M\f1\lang1033\&#39;e3 \f0\lang1066\&#39;f0\u7863?t ch\u7895? v\&#39;e0 S\u7889? CMND/Passport c\u7911?a 1 h\&#39;e0nh kh\&#39;e1ch trong v\&#39;e9.\f1\lang1033\par

\pard\f0\lang1066 Ch\u7881? \&#39;e1p d\u7909?ng cho v\&#39;e9 \&#39;f0\u7863?t KH\&#39;d4NG qua t\&#39;e0i kho\u7843?n (user_id = NULL).\f2\lang1033\par
}
</a:PreCondition>
<a:PostCondition>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\froman\fprq2\fcharset238 Times New Roman CE;}{\f1\fswiss\fcharset163 Calibri;}{\f2\froman\fprq2\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}{\f3\froman\fprq2\fcharset163 Times New Roman;}{\f4\fnil\fcharset0 Times New Roman;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20 V\&#39;e9 chuy\f1\lang1066\u7875?\f0\lang1033 n tr\f1\lang1066\u7841?\f0\lang1033 ng th\&#39;e1i &quot;\&#39;d0\f2\&#39;e3 h\f3\lang1066\u7911?y&quot;.\f4\lang1033\par
}
</a:PostCondition>
</o:UseCase>
