2. H\f1\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng ki\u7875?m tra rate-limit ch\u7889?ng d\f0\lang1033\&#39;f2 h\f1\lang1066\u7885? t\&#39;ean.\par
3. H\u7879? th\u7889?ng t\f0\lang1033\&#39;ecm booking theo m\&#39;e3, so kh\f1\lang1066\u7899?p h\u7885? t\&#39;ean (kh\&#39;f4ng ph\&#39;e2n bi\u7879?t hoa/th\&#39;fd\u7901?ng, kho\u7843?ng tr\u7855?ng th\u7915?a) v\u7899?i danh s\&#39;e1ch h\&#39;e0nh kh\&#39;e1ch trong v\&#39;e9.\f0\lang1033\par

\pard 4. H\f1\lang1066\u7879? th\u7889?ng tr\u7843? v\u7873? chi ti\u7871?t: chuy\u7871?n bay, l\u7897? tr\f0\lang1033\&#39;ecnh, h\&#39;e0nh kh\&#39;e1ch, gh\f1\lang1066\u7871?, t\u7893?ng ti\u7873?n, tr\u7841?ng th\&#39;e1i.\f3\lang1033\par
}
