{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang1066 Kh\&#39;f4ng y\&#39;eau c\u7847?u \&#39;f0\&#39;e3ng nh\u7853?p. Kh\&#39;e1ch bi\u7871?t M\f1\lang1033\&#39;e3 \f0\lang1066\&#39;f0\u7863?t ch\u7895? v\&#39;e0 H\u7885? t\&#39;ean c\u7911?a 1 h\&#39;e0nh kh\&#39;e1ch trong v\&#39;e9.\f2\lang1033\par
