{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.26100}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs20\lang1066 Chi ti\u7871?t v\&#39;e9 hi\u7875?n th\u7883? d\u7841?ng ch\u7881? xem\f1\lang1033 . \f0\lang1066 KH\&#39;d4NG h\u7911?y \&#39;f0\&#39;fd\u7907?c v\&#39;e9 t\u7915? m\&#39;e0n h\f1\lang1033\&#39;ecnh n\&#39;e0y.\f2\par
